id: pm-gantt-chart-github-072477cd0a70-153
title: Standalone SVG becomes solid black in Inkscape after CSS-variable paints in #152
description: "GH issue #153: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-gantt-chart/issues/153 · author @unbraind · created 2026-10-17T12:01:10Z · updated 2026-10-18T03:56:13Z"
type: Issue
status: open
